  "description_text": "Discover modern comfort at 321 Gallatin Park Dr Ste 201, Bozeman! This spacious 2BR, 2BA furnished unit features vaulted ceilings, hardwood floors, in-unit washer/dryer, balcony, secure building, and a garage. Dogs ok upon approval. You'll have access to both units, 101 & 201 for a work/live space combination. Enjoy a large open space and 1 car garage with a 1/2 bath downstairs. Perfect for a fitness studio, filming studio, small retail space, salon, or other small business. Upstairs you'll have a private entrance into your living space with two bedrooms and a den. Available 11/16/2026. Rent $4800. No smoking. To apply, visit TurboTenant and search for Property ID R5EVF7XW",
